o/1.0/deed.en","date":"2024-03-31 15:42:40","description":"Memorial Museum of Sun Yat-sen, Zhongshan","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/memorial-museum.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}}}},{"id":"folk-houses","name":"翠亨民居展示区","description":"沿青砖小巷，看翠亨不同家庭的生活陈设与民俗。","guide":"这里以村落民居为线索，展示翠亨的日常生活与地方习俗。官方陈列包括侨眷家庭、中等农家、木匠作坊、杂货店等内容。放慢脚步，看看巷道、门窗和厅堂的尺度，再比较不同家庭的家具与器物。这片生活背景，让故居里的人物故事多了一层乡土温度。","notice":"文物建筑开放、展览调整与入馆安排以纪念馆当日公告为准；请爱护建筑与陈设，遵守现场拍摄要求。","x":0.55663,"y":0.51799,"heading":0,"scene":"民居巷陌","narration":{"text":"这里以村落民居为线索，展示翠亨的日常生活与地方习俗。官方陈列包括侨眷家庭、中等农家、木匠作坊、杂货店等内容。放慢脚步，看看巷道、门窗和厅堂的尺度，再比较不同家庭的家具与器物。这片生活背景，让故居里的人物故事多了一层乡土温度。"},"factSource":"https://sunyat-sen.org/portal/list/index.html?id=101","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap via OpenFreeMap 20261018, z14; tile feature 91440340591","lnglat":[113.52287650108337,22.44549604457468],"photos":{"front":{"url":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/folk-houses/photos/photo-01.jpg","name":"翠亨民居展示区 · 实拍","kind":"real","accepted":true,"credit":{"title":"File:ZS 中山 Zhongshan 翠亨村民區展覽 Cuiheng Village Folk House Exhibition May 2023 Px3 13.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%8D%80%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Cuiheng_Village_Folk_House_Exhibition_May_2023_Px3_13.jpg/1280px-ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%8D%80%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Cuiheng_Village_Folk_House_Exhibition_May_2023_Px3_13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%8D%80%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Cuiheng_Village_Folk_House_Exhibition_May_2023_Px3_13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ZS_%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1_Zhongshan_%E7%BF%A0%E4%BA%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E5%