.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg/1280px-20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250904_Former_residence_of_Sun_Yat-sen.jpg","width":4096,"height":3072,"artist":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","date":"2025-09-04 14:50:08","description":"Former residence of Sun Yat-sen","retrieved":"2026-10-23","localFile":"photos/sun-residence.jpg","changes":"Wikimedia 提供的 1280px 宽缩略图；页面按容器显示或裁切。"}}}},{"id":"memorial-museum","name":"孙中山纪念馆","description":"在故居西北侧，沿展览认识孙中山的一生与家庭。","guide":"这座纪念馆与故居主楼是两处不同的建筑。纪念馆在1999年开放，2025年5月完成提升后重新迎接观众。馆内常设内容围绕孙中山的生平、亲属与后裔展开。看过故居的日常生活空间，再进入展厅阅读照片、文献和实物，能把个人经历与时代背景联系起来。","notice":"文物建筑开放、展览调整与入馆安排以纪念馆当日公告为准；请爱护建筑与陈设，遵守现场拍摄要求。","x":0.37155,"y":0.53616,"heading":0,"scene":"纪念展示区","narration":{"text":"这座纪念馆与故居主楼是两处不同的建筑。纪念馆在1999年开放，2025年5月完成提升后重新迎接观众。馆内常设内容围绕孙中山的生平、亲属与后裔展开。看过故居的日常生活空间，再进入展厅阅读照片、文献和实物，能把个人经历与时代背景联系起来。"},"factSource":"https://sunyat-sen.org/portal/article/index.html?cid=85&id=27745","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap via OpenFreeMap 20261018, z14; tile feature 9893082452","lnglat":[113.52213621139526,22.4454415062711],"photos":{"front":{"url":"/assets/scenics/sun-yat-sen/spots/memorial-museum/photos/photo-01.jpg","name":"孙中山纪念馆 · 实拍","kind":"real","accepted":true,"credit":{"title":"File:Memorial Museum of Sun Yat-sen, Zhongshan.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Memorial_Museum_of_Sun_Yat-sen%2C_Zhongshan.jpg/1280px-Memorial_Museum_of_Sun_Yat-sen%2C_Zhongshan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","original":"https://upload.wiki