uan","name":"谐趣园","description":"万寿山东麓的园中之园，仿无锡寄畅园布局，池水居中、廊亭环绕。","guide":"谐趣园最初名为惠山园，1751年参照无锡寄畅园营建，1811年重修时改为今名。池塘周围的亭、榭、楼与游廊，组成一座可以慢慢欣赏的园中园。","notice":"开放时间、预约方式与园中园门票以颐和园官方当日信息为准。","x":0.9474,"y":0.0975,"factSource":"https://summerpalace.net.cn/longevity/detailhouhu/372.html","heading":0,"scene":"后山东麓","narration":{"text":"这里是谐趣园。谐趣园最初名为惠山园，1751年参照无锡寄畅园营建，1811年重修时改为今名。池塘周围的亭、榭、楼与游廊，组成一座可以慢慢欣赏的园中园。提醒一句：开放时间、预约方式与园中园门票以颐和园官方当日信息为准。","basis":"mve8tf","adoptedAt":"2026-10-23T06:54:27.722Z"},"photos":{"front":{"url":"/assets/scenics/summer-palace/spots/xiequyuan/photos/photo-01.jpg","name":"谐趣园 · 实拍","kind":"real","credit":{"title":"File:Poem gate in Garden of Harmonious Interest (34769274).jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Poem_gate_in_Garden_of_Harmonious_Interest_%2834769274%29.jpg/1280px-Poem_gate_in_Garden_of_Harmonious_Interest_%2834769274%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Poem_gate_in_Garden_of_Harmonious_Interest_(34769274).jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","artist":"Jennifer","date":"2005-08-16 19:27","description":"谐趣园 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/summer-palace/spots/xiequyuan/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"},"accepted":true}},"revision":0,"confirmedRevision":null,"world":null},{"id":"deheyuan","name":"德和园","description":"园内的大戏楼院落，上下三层的戏台是清宫规模最大的戏台之一。","guide":"德和园从1891年开始兴建，是慈禧太后在园内看戏的地方。园中以三层大戏楼最为醒目，还有颐乐殿和庆善堂，可以结合院落布局了解清宫观戏的场景。","notice":"开放时间、预约方式与园中园门票以颐和园官方当日信息为准。","x":0.8538,"y":0.1895,"factSource":"https://summerpalace.net.cn/court_life/detail/344.html","heading":0,"scene":"东宫区","narration":{"text":"这里是德和园。德和园从1891年开始兴建，是慈禧太后在园内看戏的地方。园中以三层大戏楼最为醒目，还有颐乐殿和庆善堂，可以结合院落布局了解清宫观戏的场景。提醒一句：开放时间、预约方式与园中园门票以颐和园官方当日信息为准。","basis":"p60l8g","adoptedAt":"2026-10-23T06:54:27.722Z"},"photos":{"front":{"url":"/assets/scenics/summer-palace/spots/deheyuan/photos/photo-01.jpg","name":"德和园 · 实拍","kind":"real","credit":{"title":"File:20090530 Beijing Summer Palace 8617.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/20090530_Beijing_Summer_Palace_8617.jpg/1280px-20090530_Beijing_Summer_Palace_8617.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20090530_Beijing_Summer_Palace_8617.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","artist":"Jakub Hałun","date":"2009-05-30 16:41:43","description":"德和园 · Wikimedia Commons","path":"/assets/scenics/summer-palace/spots/deheyuan/photos/photo-01.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-23","changes":"缩放至 1280px 宽；页面缩略图按容器裁切。"},"accepted":true}},"revision":0,"confirmedRevision":null,"world":null},{"id":"zhichunting","name":"知春亭","description":"昆明湖东岸的小岛亭，经石桥与岸相连，是眺望万寿山的经典机位。","guide":"知春亭在昆明湖东岸、玉澜堂前的小岛上。这里背山朝阳，春意来得较早，亭名由此而来。从亭边眺望，可以把万寿山、昆明湖与远处西山的借景联系起来欣赏。","notice":"开放时间、预约方式与园中园门票以颐和园官方当日信息为准。","x":0.8341,"y":0.2634,"factSource":"https://summerpalace.net.cn/court_life/detail/311.html","heading":0,"scene":"东岸","narration":{"text":"这里是知春亭。知春亭在昆明湖东岸、玉澜堂前的小岛上。这里背山朝阳，春意来得较早，亭名由此而来。从亭边眺望，可以把万寿山、昆明湖与远处西山的借景联系起来欣赏。提醒一句：开放时间、预约方式与园中园门票以颐和园官方当日信息为准。","basis":"1tvr761","adoptedAt":"2026-10-23T06:54:27.722Z"},"photos":{"front":{"url":"/assets/scenics/summer-palace/spots/zhichunting/photos/photo-01.jpg","name":"知春亭 · 实拍","kind":"real","credit":{"title":"File:知春亭前的铁索桥更新换代了 - panoramio.jpg","url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/%E7%9F%A5%E6%98%A5%E4%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E9%93%81%E7%B4%A2%E6%A1%A5%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%8D%A2%E4%BB%A3%E4%BA%86_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-%E7%9F%A5%E6%98%A5%E4%BA%AD%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E9%93%81%E7%B4%A2%E6%A1%A5%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%8D%A2%E4%BB%A3%E4%BA%86_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","source":"https://commo